	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“C'mon, Soujin, let's get going already!”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Waving her hand high in the air, Elsa skips towards me like an excited puppy.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whoa, what's the rush?”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I just wanna get there already! Don't you know how long\nI've been waiting for this?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, we should've just gone by car.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I guess you have a point, but...”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"She murmurs, peering up at me with upturned eyes.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It feels more like a vacation this way, doesn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The journey is half the fun, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The journey or the destination, which one are you after?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Both!”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Come ooon, quit your grumbling and let's get going already!”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Elsa latches herself onto my arm without even waiting for my reply.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"My arm is immediately buried between the soft and perilous valley of her breasts.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Aren't you acting a bit too familiar?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"There are lots of passersby in the shopping district this time of day.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"And Elsa's little display has attracted plenty of their attention our way.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"It's not every day that you see the president and her fiancé like this, I suppose.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"But Elsa doesn't seem to pay it any mind, going as far as to smile and wave in their direction.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're taking pictures...”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We're already engaged, so what's the problem with that?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, could it be that you're embarrassed?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Elsa shows me an amused smirk, clinging to me even tighter.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"The delectably soft sensation envelops my arm even more closely.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nope, no complaints here.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Really now? I seem to recall you going on and on about setting proper boundaries.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know a lost cause when I see it.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's right, just give it up.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“After all, how can you expect me to hold back?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Elsa nuzzles her cheek against my arm as we make our way down the crowded street.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"It can't be the most comfortable way to walk, but apparently clinging to me is much more important.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"I wonder if all Republicans are this open about displaying their affection?",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Well, I guess it's not so bad to be pulled along by the hand like this if Elsa's the one doing it.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"That's why I went along with it when she asked if I wanted to go on a vacation out of the blue.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"As we continue walking, I think back to the events that led us here.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"Yesterday in her office, we were hard at work discussing the Empire's national defense policies.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Once we wrapped up the discussion, I was preparing to excuse myself and return to my duties with the Imperial Police.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Listen to this, Soujin! There's supposed to be this really nice hot spring inn just a stone's throw from here!”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's this all of a sudden?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, you know, just making small talk.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Anyways... don't you think a nice soak sounds lovely right about now?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I can't deny that... Is this inn here in Tenkyo?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sure is. Check this out!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Elsa pulls a hot spring catalog out from her desk and flips it open.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I wonder what her constituents would think, knowing that this is the sort of thing she keeps in her desk.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Honestly, I don't think I've ever met a more hardcore hot springs enthusiast.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Apparently she's been researching the Empire's hot springs and frequenting footbaths even back when she was fighting me and Akari.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Doesn't this inn here look simply wonderful?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"I take a peek at the magazine covered with sticky notes and spot an article describing the refined atmosphere of the inn in question.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"It's built on the outskirts of Tenkyo, not anywhere I've ever been before.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"The rooms with private open-air baths are apparently especially popular and booked out as soon as they become available.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've been to a lot of footbaths, but I've never actually been to a hot spring before, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Mmm... I can't wait!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"As though imagining soaking in the bath, Elsa leans back in her chair with a delighted smile on her face.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haha, it almost sounds like you have plans to go there tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ehehee, you know me too well.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Soujin, be a dear and pack our bags for us, won't you?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wait, wait, wait.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Her last words erase the smile from my face.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seriously? Tomorrow?”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I made these reservations two whole months ago.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Don't worry. I used a pseudonym, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It wouldn't be fair to them if I threw the president's name around like that.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"There's a whole lot else I want to say about my president's national priorities, but I focus on the most obvious.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can't just abandon your job like that. It'll be total chaos around here.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've already made the necessary arrangements. The government should be able to run smoothly for two days, even without me.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It'll be just fine, so let's enjoy our very first vacation together!”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...I still have my duties with the Imperial Police.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've already put in a leave request for you. Anything else?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Looks like she isn't going to take no for an answer.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Seemingly satisfied, Elsa busies herself with pouring a cup of tea.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"The billows of her flaxen hair catch the sunlight streaming in from the window, shimmering with an aureate glow.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"For several moments, I can't help but stare until I manage to pull myself together with a shake of the head.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why'd you go and hide this from me?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“To see that reaction of yours, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Elsa flashes me a mischievous smile.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Wondering if that's really all there is to it, I peer deeply into her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What's the matter? Do you like what you see?”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehehee, if you think that's enough to make me blush,\nyou've got another thing coming.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Seemingly misunderstanding my intent, Elsa retaliates by returning my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Our inexplicable staring contest goes on for ten long seconds.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"The only thing that moves is the steam curling up from her teacup.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Staaaare...”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I sense no ill will from her honest eyes and sincere smile.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"It seems like she really did plan this vacation just to get one over on me.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Never mind, it's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"I break off my gaze first.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I win this time!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Elsa sips her tea with a triumphant smirk.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, it'll just be the two of us, so I'll be counting on you to keep me safe.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Of course, you'll also be doing your best to show me a good time, won't you?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Demanding, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ehehee, I'd only ever ask this much out of you.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't I know it.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"I whisper, bringing my face in towards Elsa's.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"She flutters her eyes shut and raises her chin to accept me.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Nmm...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Our lips come together.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The fragrance of the tea still lingering on her lips tickles my nostrils and spreads across the tip of my tongue.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"A delicate, faintly citrusy aroma.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"I pull back slightly, thinking for a few moments.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Darjeeling, was it?”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Full marks.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You've gotten pretty good at telling different black teas apart, haven't you?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"I've started learning a lot more about black tea ever since I became Elsa's lover.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, you didn't use to kiss me nearly as much, either.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We Imperials aren't as uninhibited as you Republicans.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Though, I guess I've gotten used to it by now.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Sounds like my daily kissing regime is paying real dividends.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, just so we're clear, I only ever do it with you, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I know.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Elsa nods in satisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Still, though... I sort of miss being able to see you so flustered all the time.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Even you-know-what hasn't been the most exciting recently...”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've just gotten used to your wild antics.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"“You-know-what” refers to our nightly activities.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Elsa recently awakened to her dominant side after certain events, and has been making a real habit out of it.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Of course, I still try to take the lead whenever I can, such that our current win-loss record is dead even.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“It's been a while since I've made you swallow your pride.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, don't you think a new location would spice things up?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...You'd better not be saying you want to do it in the middle of town.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Elsa claps her hands as if to say, “That's it!”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll go ahead and get ready for tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"I move to beat a hasty retreat.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm just kidding!”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Buuut... doing it in a different place than usual does sound a little exciting.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Just another one of my little jokes.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I open my mouth to scold her again, but the blissful smile on her face as she drinks her tea shuts me up.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Finishing up with her tea, her gaze drifts dreamily down towards her magazine.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I can't wait for tomorrow...”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm so excited to go to my first hot spring together with you.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"She starts humming happily.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Before I know it, I notice myself in high spirits as well.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Which brings us to where we are now.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Yep, Elsa is still clinging tightly to my arm.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Ehehee, I can't wait!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's try to act a little bit more restrained, Madam President.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"I lightly chide her, but there's an unmistakable bounce to my step as well.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, I remember there being another hot spring right along the way.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why would we visit another hot spring on our way to the hot springs?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Mm, you have a point...”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"I can't tell if she's joking or serious.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Elsa's favorite aspect of Imperial culture is our bathing customs.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"She's normally a workaholic, but she still never misses the opportunity to take a good soak.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"And she really makes herself comfortable.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Once, she was in there for nearly three hours.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Still, it's hard to imagine that this is your first time going to the hot springs.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"I'd thought for sure that she would've gone plenty of times by now.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I was always busy while I was in the army, and I'm even busier now that I'm in office.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If I have enough time to visit the hot springs, it must be proof that the Empire is finally becoming more peaceful.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's one way to think about it.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In that case, maybe I should be hitting the hot springs a lot more often then.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right... Wait, that's some faulty logic.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I can never get one past you, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Elsa cutely sticks out her tongue.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehee, I get to be alone with you aaall day long today.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I've got a little treat in store for you later, so look forward to it.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Elsa not-so-subtly pushes her chest against my arm as she flashes me a knowing smile.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think I will.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"I give a safe reply.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"I've learned by now that she'll just tease me if I give her anything more.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Elsa purses her lips in disappointment.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Soujin, you're no fun anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've said it before, and I'll say it again. I've just gotten used to it.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Mmh... I knew it, we really do need to spice things up a little.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Elsa falls silent, seemingly deep in thought.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"I know better than to go looking for trouble by asking\nwhat's on her mind.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"I decide to forcibly change the subject before things start going in a dangerous direction.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, it's been a while since I've been to an open-air bath as well.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Right? It looked plenty big enough for the both of us, and the view looked simply to die for.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You want to get in together?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Huh? Isn't it only natural for two lovers to be bathing together?”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Elsa smoothly replies with a slight tilt of the head.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"She's making it sound like I'm the weird one here.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll even wash your back for you.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Right.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Maybe I really am a bit too old-fashioned.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“That's right, Soujin! Aren't you getting a little hungry?”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, it is almost lunchtime.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"I suppose I am feeling a bit peckish.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is there anything you want to eat? I'll go with whatever\nyou're up for.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hmm, let's see...”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Elsa takes in all the nearby restaurants.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We've got a long night of hot se─ I mean, hot springs ahead of us, so how about some meat to keep you energetic?”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And garlic as well... Actually, scratch that. It'll be a turn-off if I smell it when we kiss.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What are you even talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Well, I don't doubt that we'll get into it one way or another once we lay out our futons for the night...",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"But isn't she getting a little ahead of herself here?",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"In the end, Elsa sets her eyes on a street vendor hawking meat skewers.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Here you go. Eat up, now.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Have this liver skewer, too. It's rich in zinc, so it'll be killing two birds with one stone.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What birds are those supposed to be?”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Still, though, I accept it and bring it up to my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Elsa stares at me until I finish the whole thing.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa... is it just me, or do I have one of your plots in my future?”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, whatever could you be talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"She decides to play dumb.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"But she only wipes the smirk off her face once she bites into her own skewer.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, this is pretty good!”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Soujin, you try some, too!”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"In the end, I'm unable to get another word in edgewise.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've got a bad feeling about this...”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You'll be just fine. Even I have certain lines I wouldn't cross.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"In between each of her bites, that familiar smirk makes yet another appearance.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"Am I imagining things, or did she look awfully like a man-eating predator just now?",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"...I really hope I'm imagining things.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"Shortly afterwards, we arrive at the inn.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"We're promptly shown to our room, upon which Elsa and I immediately make for the open-air bath.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah... how did I know this was what you were after?”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“You could always put up some resistance, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"To keep a long story short, I walked right into Elsa's little plot.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"Elsa's body goes limp in my embrace, drained entirely of all its strength.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"I'm almost entirely spent, myself.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"The two of our bodies are completely sticky with sweat, so perhaps it's a good thing that we're already in the bath.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Heh... hehehee...! I'm really glad I could spend my first hot spring vacation together with you.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Elsa's love for hot springs has existed for a lot longer than her love for me.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"It wasn't too long ago that we were still bitter enemies.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"I never would have ever imagined that we'd be like this now, enjoying a hot spring vacation like this.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm so glad I decided to wait all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I don't think I'll ever forget the memories from this trip... Ehehee.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Elsa shows me a brilliant smile, and I bring our lips together once more.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"From now into the future, I hope to make many more unforgettable memories together with her.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
